      "origin": {
        "leaf": "260921-ICR-L46"
      },
      "rationale": "Is the production entry for recording a comparison: it resolves the candidate exactly as the review surface does and passes it to freeze_resolved_review, returning a resolution refusal unchanged, so the one per-leaf generation is frozen from the comparison the surface itself composes.",
